000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. RRDSNATD.
000300*    RRDSRAND, written against native VSAM instead of VSAMIO.
000400*    Adds, changes and deletes RRDS records by record number.
000500 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
000600 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
000700 FILE-CONTROL.
000800     SELECT RECORD-IMAGES ASSIGN TO UR-2540R-S-CARDIN.
000900     SELECT RRDS-FILE ASSIGN TO RRDSF01
001000         ORGANIZATION IS RELATIVE
001100         ACCESS IS RANDOM
001200         RELATIVE KEY IS WS-RRN
001300         FILE STATUS IS WS-STATUS.
001400 DATA DIVISION.
001500 FILE SECTION.
001600 FD  RECORD-IMAGES
001700     LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
001800 01  RECORD-IMAGE.
001900     02  RI-ACTION               PIC X(01).
002000     02  FILLER                  PIC X(01).
002100     02  RI-IMAGE                PIC X(78).
002200 FD  RRDS-FILE
002300     LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD
002400     RECORD CONTAINS 80 CHARACTERS.
002500 01  RRDS-RECORD.
002600     02  RR-KEY.
002700         03  RRK-HIGH            PIC 9(7).
002800         03  RRK-LOW             PIC 9(3).
002900     02  FILLER                  PIC X(70).
003000 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
003100 01  WS-RRN                      PIC 9(8) COMP VALUE 0.
003200 01  WS-STATUS                   PIC X(2)  VALUE '00'.
003300 01  END-OF-FILE-SWITCH          PIC X(1)  VALUE 'N'.
003400     88  END-OF-FILE                       VALUE 'Y'.
003500 01  FOUND-SWITCH                PIC X(1)  VALUE 'Y'.
003600     88  FOUND                             VALUE 'Y'.
003700 01  OP-FAILED-SWITCH            PIC X(1)  VALUE 'N'.
003800     88  OP-FAILED                         VALUE 'Y'.
003900 01  COUNTER-EDIT                PIC ZZ,ZZZ,ZZ9.
004000 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
004100 000-INITIATE.
004200     DISPLAY 'RRDSRAND: READ/REWRITE RRDS DIRECT'.
004300     DISPLAY '----------------------------------'.
004400     DISPLAY ' '.
004500     OPEN INPUT RECORD-IMAGES.
004600     OPEN I-O RRDS-FILE.
004700     IF WS-STATUS NOT = '00'
004800         DISPLAY 'VSAM ERROR DURING OPEN, STATUS ' WS-STATUS
004900         MOVE 'Y' TO END-OF-FILE-SWITCH.
005000 010-PROCESS.
005100     PERFORM 110-PROCESS-UPDATES THRU 119-EXIT UNTIL END-OF-FILE.
005200 020-TERMINATE.
005300     CLOSE RECORD-IMAGES.
005400     CLOSE RRDS-FILE.
005500     STOP RUN.
005600 110-PROCESS-UPDATES.
005700     READ RECORD-IMAGES
005800         AT END MOVE 'Y' TO END-OF-FILE-SWITCH.
005900     IF NOT END-OF-FILE
006000         PERFORM 111-DISPATCH THRU 112-EXIT.
006100 119-EXIT.
006200     EXIT.
006300 111-DISPATCH.
006400     IF RI-ACTION = 'A'
006500         PERFORM 120-ADD-PROCESS THRU 129-EXIT.
006600     IF RI-ACTION = 'C'
006700         PERFORM 130-CHANGE-PROCESS THRU 139-EXIT.
006800     IF RI-ACTION = 'D'
006900         PERFORM 140-DELETE-PROCESS THRU 149-EXIT.
007000 112-EXIT.
007100     EXIT.
007200 120-ADD-PROCESS.
007300     MOVE RI-IMAGE TO RRDS-RECORD.
007400     MOVE RRK-LOW TO WS-RRN.
007500     MOVE WS-RRN TO COUNTER-EDIT.
007600     DISPLAY COUNTER-EDIT ': ADDING: ' RRDS-RECORD.
007700     MOVE 'N' TO OP-FAILED-SWITCH.
007800     WRITE RRDS-RECORD
007900         INVALID KEY MOVE 'Y' TO OP-FAILED-SWITCH.
008000     IF NOT OP-FAILED
008100         DISPLAY '               RECORD ADDED'.
008200     IF OP-FAILED AND WS-STATUS = '22'
008300         DISPLAY '            *** DUPLICATE RECORD ON FILE'.
008400     IF OP-FAILED AND WS-STATUS NOT = '22'
008500         DISPLAY 'VSAM ERROR ON WRITE, STATUS ' WS-STATUS.
008600     DISPLAY ' '.
008700 129-EXIT.
008800     EXIT.
008900 130-CHANGE-PROCESS.
009000     PERFORM 150-READ-RECORD THRU 159-EXIT.
009100     IF NOT FOUND
009200         MOVE WS-RRN TO COUNTER-EDIT
009300         DISPLAY COUNTER-EDIT ' *** RECORD NOT FOUND'
009400         DISPLAY ' '.
009500     IF FOUND
009600         PERFORM 132-DO-CHANGE THRU 133-EXIT.
009700 139-EXIT.
009800     EXIT.
009900 132-DO-CHANGE.
010000     MOVE WS-RRN TO COUNTER-EDIT.
010100     DISPLAY COUNTER-EDIT ': ' RRDS-RECORD.
010200     DISPLAY '               RECORD BEFORE CHANGE'.
010300     MOVE RI-IMAGE TO RRDS-RECORD.
010400     MOVE 'N' TO OP-FAILED-SWITCH.
010500     REWRITE RRDS-RECORD
010600         INVALID KEY MOVE 'Y' TO OP-FAILED-SWITCH.
010700     IF NOT OP-FAILED
010800         MOVE WS-RRN TO COUNTER-EDIT
010900         DISPLAY COUNTER-EDIT ': ' RRDS-RECORD
011000         DISPLAY '               RECORD AFTER CHANGE'.
011100     IF OP-FAILED
011200         DISPLAY 'VSAM ERROR ON REWRITE, STATUS ' WS-STATUS.
011300     DISPLAY ' '.
011400 133-EXIT.
011500     EXIT.
011600 140-DELETE-PROCESS.
011700     PERFORM 150-READ-RECORD THRU 159-EXIT.
011800     IF NOT FOUND
011900         MOVE WS-RRN TO COUNTER-EDIT
012000         DISPLAY COUNTER-EDIT ' *** RECORD NOT FOUND'
012100         DISPLAY ' '.
012200     IF FOUND
012300         PERFORM 142-DO-DELETE THRU 143-EXIT.
012400 149-EXIT.
012500     EXIT.
012600 142-DO-DELETE.
012700     MOVE WS-RRN TO COUNTER-EDIT.
012800     DISPLAY COUNTER-EDIT ': ' RRDS-RECORD.
012900     DISPLAY '               RECORD BEFORE DELETE'.
013000     MOVE 'N' TO OP-FAILED-SWITCH.
013100     DELETE RRDS-FILE
013200         INVALID KEY MOVE 'Y' TO OP-FAILED-SWITCH.
013300     IF NOT OP-FAILED
013400         DISPLAY '             DELETED'.
013500     IF OP-FAILED
013600         DISPLAY 'VSAM ERROR ON DELETE, STATUS ' WS-STATUS.
013700     DISPLAY ' '.
013800 143-EXIT.
013900     EXIT.
014000 150-READ-RECORD.
014100     MOVE RI-IMAGE TO RRDS-RECORD.
014200     MOVE RRK-LOW TO WS-RRN.
014300     MOVE 'Y' TO FOUND-SWITCH.
014400     READ RRDS-FILE
014500         INVALID KEY MOVE 'N' TO FOUND-SWITCH.
014600 159-EXIT.
014700     EXIT.
